## SQ-FLR-01 | flesh recipes and result pools load
@group A
@commands Boot; `grep -nE "result-pools\|has more outputs\|visceral_heap\|\[NCH\].*(flesh\|pus_bubble\|hair\|eyebulb\|blood\|plantoil)\|Mixing (CrushingOutputCap\|ProcessingInventory\|JeiCrushingPools\|JeiMillingPools)" logs/latest.log`
@pass the 4 `creativeworldgen:create*/visceral_heap/*` crush and mill recipes and 5 mixing recipes load; no `[result-pools]` error, no Create "more outputs" warning, no NCH warning except the one-time `#forge:plantoil` tag note
@fails a stale Common jar leaves `i.flesh` undefined (NCH `is undefined`); missing mixin lines mean the Engineering jar is stale
@from batches/r1111/a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell grep -nE "result-pools|has more outputs|visceral_heap|\[NCH\].*(flesh|pus_bubble|hair|eyebulb|blood|plantoil)|Mixing (CrushingOutputCap|ProcessingInventory|JeiCrushingPools|JeiMillingPools)" logs/latest.log | cut -c1-250 | head -40
bootreject (?i)\[result-pools\].*error
bootreject has more outputs
> cdevtest bytype create:crushing max=5000
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=bytype serializer=create:crushing n= 30
> cdevtest bytype create:milling max=5000
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=bytype serializer=create:milling n= 30
> cdevtest bytype create:mixing max=5000
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=bytype serializer=create:mixing n= 30
count \[cdevtest\] verb=bytype id=creativeworldgen:create\w*/visceral_heap/ >= 9
look 4 crush/mill + 5 mixing creativeworldgen visceral_heap recipes listed

## SQ-FLR-02 | crushing wheels fed by a hopper: 200 flesh, then 200 porous flesh, outputs by pool
@group A
@commands Crushing wheels fed by a hopper: 200 flesh in stacks of 64, collect everything; then 200 porous flesh; count per item (`/clear @s <item> 0`)
@pass flesh: meat items total 200 exactly, bone near 150, eye near 50, misc near 50; porous: meat 300 +/- 25, eye 200 exactly, misc near 100, no bone; item splits near plan section 3
@fails `fan/ResultPools.roll`; a meat total above 200 means pools did not apply (Create's independent roll); any loss means the wheel inventory did not grow (`ProcessingInventoryMixin`)
@from batches/r1115/p9_a1.qb
