waitlog \[zc4\] done 20
expect \[zc4\] put 40200 -59 40000 biomesoplenty:flesh inserted=20
> cdevtest tickwarp 3000
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=tickwarp end=done ticks=3000 150
> cdevtest inv 40200 -59 40000
