count \[zc4\] pools meat=20 bone=\d+ eye=\d+ misc=\d+ >= 1
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=inv slot=\d+ item=biomesoplenty:flesh\*
look the chest pools line: meat=20 exactly, flesh used up (millstone `verb=inv` lines show no flesh); bone near 15, eye near 5, misc near 5; the hopper itself may still hold up to 5 stacks (`cdevtest inv 40200 -60 40000` by hand if meat is 15-19)

